| Coded text wrapped into lines: every fifth space since a line end becomes a line end.
| states: < 20 = # of spaces since last line end
|   20 = just copying until something other than space or hyphen
| universal rules
-~-~~20~  | in general, preserve hyphens, and go to state 20
|258~|258~~1~ | in general, existing eol's preserved and made "native", reset state
|257~|258~ | always put an EOL at EOF
| states 1-4: note space, advance to next state
 ~ ~1~2~
 ~ ~2~3~
 ~ ~3~4~
 ~ ~4~5~
| state 5: transform space to eol & reset state
 ~|258~5~1~
| state 20: just copy through next not space nor hyphen, then to st 2
|258~ ~20~ | these eol's must be turned back to spaces
